    "semantic_summary": "AgentRunService is the core controller managing the lifecycle of agent execution instances over HTTP. It orchestrates runs by handling model loading via BrainHub, tracking state using AgentRun, and managing user interaction through WebAgentIO. It enforces strict filesystem boundaries via workspace control and handles API errors related to concurrency or permissions."
